                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>候选 W · 两组相同</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>76 步</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>2026-10-18　09:00—10:15{'\n'}Asia/Shanghai　·　1 分钟／步</Text>
